WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.683
Adult pads on a child.

00:00:01.683 --> 00:00:09.255
For a child, the 2022 manual permits an AED with adult pads when no paediatric system is available.

00:00:09.255 --> 00:00:22.105
Pads must not touch or overlap; with adult pads, use front-and-back placement with one pad on the central sternum and one on the upper back between the shoulder blades.
